    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">myxa</span></b> , ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύξα</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
